<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'PingFang SC' }}>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 64, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 21, fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>知迹 · 答辩汇报</Text>
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 1010, top: 21, width: 194, textAlign: 'right', fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF' }}>导览与结论</Text>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 92, width: 1128 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 31, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>三项工程约束，把「能答」变成「可交付」</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 10 }}>本页是全文摘要：读完这一页即可掌握结论，后面每页只负责证明其中一条</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 186, width: 460, height: 388, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>汇报路线（5 段）</Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 12 }}>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 68, alignItems: 'flex-start', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB', paddingTop: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 34 }}>01</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 340 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>背景与目标</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 4 }}>问题在哪、要做到什么</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', width: 60, textAlign: 'right' }}>p3</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 68, alignItems: 'flex-start', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB', paddingTop: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 34 }}>02</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 340 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>技术选型与架构</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 4 }}>为什么选这些、怎么搭</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', width: 60, textAlign: 'right' }}>p4–5</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 68, alignItems: 'flex-start', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB', paddingTop: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 34 }}>03</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 340 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>三项关键实现</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 4 }}>检索 / 可恢复 / 可度量</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', width: 60, textAlign: 'right' }}>p6–8</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 68, alignItems: 'flex-start', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB', paddingTop: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 34 }}>04</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 340 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>实际使用与指标</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 4 }}>真实界面与实测数据</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', width: 60, textAlign: 'right' }}>p9</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 68, alignItems: 'flex-start', paddingTop: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 34 }}>05</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 340 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>边界与下一步</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 4 }}>没做什么、接着做什么</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', width: 60, textAlign: 'right' }}>p10</Text>
      </Box>

    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 588, top: 186, width: 616, height: 388, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>三条结论</Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 12 }}>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 116, borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 14, paddingTop: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
          一、把回合画成状态图，是「可恢复」与「可拦截」的共同前提
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 8 }}>
          四个失败点（断线 / 工具失败 / 忘事 / 越权写）各有对应机制，不是靠提示词嘱咐。见 p6–8。
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 116, borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 14, paddingTop: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
          二、四路召回 + 名次融合，补上了中文短词与同义异名的漏召回
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 8 }}>
          35 题里 34 题首次命中；接真实向量模型 35 题全中，且引用可落到「第 N 页」。见 p6。
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 116, borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 14, paddingTop: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
          三、质量不靠感觉：284 项测试与 0.05 容差构成自动拦截
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 8 }}>
          每次改动跑同一套考卷，掉出容差即命令非零退出，可直接接入提交前检查。见 p8。
        </Text>
      </Box>

    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 580, width: 1128, height: 48, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>
      叙述方式：结论先行 → 逐项举证 → 主动说明边界；标题连起来读，即为完整论证
